WEBVTT

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.730
It's way too chilly today.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.770
Ever since this gate broke,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.900
cold winds have been blowing through the capital.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:35.280
There are rumors that spirits are invading the capital!

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.180
This gate might've been their doing, too.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.220
So frightening!

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.050
Hey!

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.290
Get your lazy asses up and your hands moving!

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.220
Got it.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:57.130
Jeez, these bums always slack off if they're not being watched.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:01.770
Well, the sun's gone down.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.260
Looks like that's it for today.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:23.890
Spirits!

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.950
Evil spirits have appeared!

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.790
Spirits are an illusion created by the human heart,

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:02.360
but there are creatures among those illusions that consume humans.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:06.270
Such creatures are called Horrors.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.470
So you want to enter the capital?

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:11.370
However, this is a place where people live.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.110
Return to the darkness!

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.890
A Makai Alchemist?

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:31.890
Your power alone cannot stop us!

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.560
Who said I was alone?

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.730
The Golden Knight?!

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:51.250
I've heard that the bloodline of that armor has long disappeared!

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:53.810
Well, we don't really advertise his existence.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:27.890
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:36.020
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:43.230
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:52.270
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:04:01.620
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:09.460
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:17.330
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:27.330
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:33.510
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:37.960
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:42.950
"ONMYOU"

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.450
So beautiful.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:13.620
Even I, Michinaga, would visit you secretly regardless of age.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.780
Thank you very much.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.730
What is the matter, Kintou?

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.200
Spirits have appeared at the Rajou Gate once again.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.900
Many carpenters have died.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.140
And what of it?

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.210
Lately, there have been various cases in the capital

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.210
that can only be explained by evil spirits.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.050
Has a single spirit ever stepped foot in this Light Palace?

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.150
Never has that happened!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.820
The Light Palace is protected by the Onmyouryo today as well.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.550
We would never allow a spirit to approach this place.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:56.830
Eternal glory to the Heavenly
Emperor and the Light Palace.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.700
Yes!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:05.110
That is enough during daylight, but what of the night?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:10.040
Only the poor common people, who carry no status, travel at night.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.610
It is not something to worry about.

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:16.520
So the spirits own the night.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.280
Such a mysterious woman entertainer like her.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.050
Just how long are you going to allow her at our house?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.550
But those hips... I mean, <i>biwa</i>! Such talent!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.420
The guests are all enjoying it as well.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:58.380
That Seimei. How indecent!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:05.500
Seimei-<i>dono</i>, please have this.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.840
It is the tooth of a whale.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:12.670
Hoh. Of a whale! That is rare.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.180
Oh! And it even has a cavity!

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.350
Wonderful. Wonderful.
A piece with such depth and subtlety!

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.350
Honey!

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.450
Please stop!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.950
That is a treasured family heirloom!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.090
Let me go!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:28.120
I shall not!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.860
Then, I will take these sweets.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:33.690
What? Is that all you want?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:45.010
Raiko-<i>sama</i>. It seems
Seimei is gone, once again.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.270
I'm sure she is off playing at another aristocrat's mansion.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.210
Like usual.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.470
It's done.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:19.240
Oh, how beautiful.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.590
Hm?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.260
I see. This Nio statue...

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.260
Yes.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.870
It is said that he walks the land every night.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:50.070
So we have decided to insert a bodhisattva to quell his anger.

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.680
Oh, he's here.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.780
This is Junkei-<i>sama.</i>

00:08:56.780 --> 00:09:00.580
He is the most skilled
Buddha sculptor in the capital.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.350
Junkei-<i>sama</i>, thank you for coming here today.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.220
No, it's nothing.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.140
No good.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.300
Huh?!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:36.920
This isn't enough? Is that what the Nio statue is saying?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.290
There was no life in that bodhisattva.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.780
What?

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:44.550
Who is that person?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.250
That is Seimei-<i>sama.</i>

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.070
Please, wait!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.970
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.270
I just felt there was no life in that bodhisattva.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:01.010
Only a bodhisattva imbued with life can calm the Nio statue.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:04.270
Maybe if I use a more beautiful woman as a base...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:09.620
Isn't the only life you can imbue in a bodhisattva your own?

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:13.210
It's pointless to depend on another's strength.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:17.820
What did you say?!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.270
It looks like we will make it, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:30.330
We need to finish these today and exchange them for rice.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.110
Right.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.680
Let's take a break. Kintoki, I've grown thirsty.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.580
Yes! I will make you some tea.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:54.220
Forgive me, Kintoki.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.390
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.170
What the hell!

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:04.670
I know that you plan to examine that Nio statue.

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:05.670
That's right.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:09.540
You've heard the rumors of the Nio statue that walks at night.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.980
You believe it could be the work of a Horror?

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.720
It's the duty of a Makai Knight to investigate.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.920
Even like this?

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.690
The Madou Ring is still stone.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.020
Who cares!

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:23.920
I shall eliminate Horrors on my own!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:28.430
I shall go with you. I am your one and only attendant, after all.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.990
Do what you want.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:36.940
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:37.940
Hm?

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.570
The Nio statue...

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:42.580
So it seems.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.410
We must find the Nio statue.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.880
Yes!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:05.060
Imbue with life!

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:14.540
Why? Why do you not imbue with life?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:18.380
A woman... A more beautiful woman!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.480
N-Nio-<i>sama.</i>

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:32.490
P-Please forgive me. I cannot carve a bodhisattva that will calm you.

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:35.600
What is your wish?

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.930
Life... I wish to carve a
Buddha with coursing blood,

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:41.340
the most beautiful bodhisattva in the world!

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:44.440
For that, I will sacrifice anything!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.130
I was waiting...

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.940
...for those words.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.820
So beautiful.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.300
Raiko-<i>sama...</i>

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:58.510
Let's go home. I'm so hungry.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:01.540
Goodness. Go home alone if you'd like!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.840
No! I am your attendant!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:04.710
Hm?

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.150
Hm? What is the matter?

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.520
Get down.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.450
What are you doing so suddenly?!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.940
Shh!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.400
Look! Blood.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.980
How terrible.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.050
Unforgivable.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.430
That must be the Buddha sculptor, Junkei.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:56.060
Has that man been possessed with a Horror?

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.430
You know of him?

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.770
Yes, a little.

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.500
So, what happened?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:07.580
Was that sculptor able to make a bodhisattva worthy of a Nio statue?

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.510
No.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.180
There were only women who were turned into bodhisattvas.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.080
All of them were only partially carved.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.550
Oh! That's right! Put out your hand, Raiko.

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:17.350
What is it?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.090
A gift I received.

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:21.890
They are sugar sweets from another country.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.690
S-So tasty! What is this?!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.600
Right? Right? Right?

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.060
I want some as well!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:34.070
Oh, Kintoki. Here!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:38.410
Delicious! I feel my cheeks melting!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:41.410
It can't be helped. I shall lend you a hand.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.740
What? Who needs your help?!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:47.280
What can you do alone?

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.770
Hm?

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:54.920
And, I'm the only beautiful woman here.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:57.760
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, this is where you interject with an argument.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.090
Yeah, I guess.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.030
You fell for it, Junkei!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.500
You cannot escape this barrier.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:39.390
I will never forgive anything that takes advantage

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.360
of the weakness in people's hearts.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:47.270
There are creatures from Makai that possess humans and consume them...

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.380
Such creatures are called Horrors!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.010
Such pressure from his blade!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:06.750
It's useless. You can't escape from here.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.950
That's right! That's right!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.110
Seimei, what are you watching for?

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.810
Even though he's a Makai Knight, he can't win without his armor!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.810
Don't say unnecessary things, Kintoki!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.610
But!

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:15.450
It can't be helped.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.750
Raiko!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.170
That is...!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.700
Madou Ring Zaruba!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:50.020
Goodness. It has been a while since I last returned.

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:08.010
Hurry and finish up.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.360
Something like that would never work against the Golden Knight.

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:16.980
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, are you all right?

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:18.950
You did a good job.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:50.480
The blade of the Golden Knight.

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:52.140
Who are you?

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.320
Is he a Horror as well?

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:02.520
No. He's worse than that.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:06.530
I am darkness. A darkness without light.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:11.550
I was born from the darkness and have become darkness itself.

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:38.030
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:45.000
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:52.170
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:59.080
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.680
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.260
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:11.890
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:16.560
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:23.570
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:30.040
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:37.280
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.590
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:48.290
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.960
"Next Episode: TIED SWORD"

00:23:52.220 --> 00:23:55.720
There are things you cannot reach no matter how much you desire it.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.720
The more you desire, the more it escapes you.

00:23:57.720 --> 00:24:00.160
Then why not stop desiring it?
